  "admissionRules": [
    "Discovery results never become CURRENT_DATA by search rank or source count.",
    "Every admitted current claim must satisfy Current Web Authority source, domain, freshness, claim-type and provenance contracts.",
    "Direct evidence lanes may contain admitted facts; capacity/load/alignment/resilience/adaptability/futureCapacity remain derived readings.",
    "A runtime-position candidate must cite admitted evidence references and an RRE lineage reference.",
    "A runtime-position candidate may be primary, secondary or subsystem-scoped; no forced single global position.",
    "Conflicted evidence blocks promotion unless conflict resolution returns an admitted authority outcome.",
    "Position candidate generation is not position admission; owner human review remains mandatory.",
    "Position admission does not itself establish transition or threshold crossing.",
    "No weighted score, probability or civilization ranking is created."
  ],
